<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Duty Free to be delisted on Dec 31.</title>
<headline>NZ Duty Free to be delisted on Dec 31.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Thursday New Zealand Duty Free will be de-listed from the close of business on December 31.</p>
<p>The company was suspended from trading on the exchange indefinitely from October 1 for failure to comply with the spread requirements of Rule 5.2.3.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
